== the audit job also calls verify
file: .github/workflows/audit.yml
message: job audit runs vibe audit and also calls the verify command `task verify`
fix: run vibe audit in a job of its own that does not call verify

== the audit job calls one command of a list verify
file: .github/workflows/audit.yml
message: job audit runs vibe audit and also calls the verify command `task test`
fix: run vibe audit in a job of its own that does not call verify

== no audit job
file: .github/workflows/
message: no job of a workflow that runs on pull requests runs vibe audit (a paths filter, a tags filter without branches, a types filter without opened, synchronize and reopened, or branch filters that leave the branch out make a workflow not count)
fix: add a job, triggered on pull_request, whose step runs vibe audit (any arguments) and that does not call verify

