== verify missing points at V-04
file: vibe.yaml
message: this rule needs the verify entrypoint, and V-04 finds it unusable: entrypoints.verify is not declared
fix: fix V-04 first: declare entrypoints.verify as the command that runs it, such as task verify

== another CI provider
file: Jenkinsfile
message: contract 1.2.0 reads GitHub Actions and GitLab CI only, and this repository's CI is Jenkinsfile
fix: run CI in GitHub Actions under .github/workflows/ or in GitLab CI (.gitlab-ci.yml), or wait for a vibe that reads this provider
